<% layout("layouts/boilerplate.ejs") -%>
<body>
<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">
        <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p class="text-muted">
            <strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 18, 2026
        </p>

        <hr>

        <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p>
            Depending on how you use RoamNest, we may collect information such as
            your name, email address, username, profile information, and other
            information that you voluntarily provide.
        </p>

        <h4>Account Information</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Name</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Username</li>
            <li>Password in securely protected form</li>
            <li>Profile information you choose to provide</li>
        </ul>

        <h4>Listing Information</h4>
        <p>
            If you create a property listing, we may collect information such as
            property title, description, images, price, location, country/city,
            property category, and amenities.
        </p>

        <h4>Reviews and User Content</h4>
        <p>
            Reviews, comments, images, and other content that you voluntarily
            submit may be stored and displayed on RoamNest.
        </p>

        <h4>Technical Information</h4>
        <p>
            We may automatically receive technical information such as your IP
            address, browser type, device information, pages visited, and date
            and time of visits.
        </p>

        <h3>2. Location Information</h3>
        <p>
            RoamNest may use property location information to display listings
            and locations on an interactive map. Third-party mapping or
            geocoding services may be used to convert location information
            into geographical coordinates.
        </p>

        <h3>3. How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <p>We may use collected information to:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Create and manage user accounts</li>
            <li>Display property listings</li>
            <li>Allow users to create, edit, and delete listings</li>
            <li>Display property locations</li>
            <li>Allow users to submit reviews</li>
            <li>Improve website functionality</li>
            <li>Maintain website security</li>
            <li>Detect unauthorized activity</li>
            <li>Communicate with users when necessary</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4. Data Storage and Security</h3>
        <p>
            RoamNest may use third-party databases and hosting services to
            store information. We take reasonable measures to protect
            information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure,
            or destruction.
        </p>

        <p>
            However, no internet-based service can guarantee complete security.
        </p>

        <h3>5. Password Security</h3>
        <p>
            Users are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their
            account credentials. If you believe your account has been accessed
            without authorization, please contact RoamNest as soon as possible.
        </p>

        <h3>6. Cookies</h3>
        <p>
            RoamNest may use cookies and similar technologies to maintain
            sessions, remember preferences, improve website functionality,
            and understand website usage.
        </p>

        <h3>7. Third-Party Services</h3>
        <p>
            RoamNest may use third-party services for database hosting,
            authentication, maps, geocoding, website hosting, analytics,
            and image storage.
        </p>

        <p>
            These services may process information according to their own
            privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h3>8. User-Generated Content</h3>
        <p>
            Information that you voluntarily make public, including property
            listings, reviews, descriptions, and listing images, may be visible
            to other visitors.
        </p>

        <p>
            Please do not publish sensitive personal information in publicly
            visible areas of RoamNest.
        </p>

        <h3>9. Data Retention</h3>
        <p>
            We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to
            provide our services, maintain accounts, resolve disputes,
            maintain security, and comply with applicable requirements.
        </p>

        <h3>10. Children's Privacy</h3>
        <p>
            RoamNest is not intended for children who are not legally permitted
            to use online services. We do not knowingly collect personal
            information from children without appropriate authorization.
        </p>

        <h3>11. Your Privacy Rights</h3>
        <p>
            Depending on applicable law, you may have rights to request access,
            correction, or deletion of your personal information.
        </p>

        <h3>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When changes
            are made, we will update the "Last Updated" date on this page.
        </p>

        <h3>13. Contact Us</h3>
        <p>
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
            RoamNest through the contact information provided on the website.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-5 p-4 bg-light rounded">
            <strong>RoamNest</strong>
            <p class="mb-0">
                Your journey, your stay, your RoamNest.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
